      "problem": "The live SDK emits one assistant frame per completed content block; frames from one step repeat the same message.id and usage snapshot. ClaudeProvider currently adds each snapshot, inflating cumulative input/cache usage and persisted discovery_tokens.",
      "change": "Deduplicate reported usage by nonempty string message.id for the current turn, without skipping content dispatch. Register an ID only when a usage block exists and clear the set at the result boundary. Unidentified gateway frames keep their existing fallback behavior; result usage, retry/handoff and paid-send rules are unchanged.",
